DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261114
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261115
UID:b43535029c44e0822d21182202ef218d@visitmorgancountyin.com
DESCRIPTION:Bradford Woods will host an Open Gate Day on November 14! Stop
  by between 10 am and 2 pm for a fun day in the outdoors with free fishing
 \, ziplining\, rope climbing\, archery\, and hiking! Pack a picnic and enj
 oy lunch on the property\, too. Here are a few important details: Ziplinin
 g and climbing participants must weigh at least 50 lbs. Anyone age 18 or o
 lder who plans to fish must have a valid Indiana fishing license. Please b
 ring your own bait and tackle. Fishing is land-based only.
LOCATION:Bradford Woods\, 5040 State Road 67 North\, Martinsville\, IN
URL:https://www.visitmorgancountyin.com/event/open-gate-day-at-bradford-wo
 ods/11923/
X-SOURCE:Visit Morgan County
END:VEVENT
